 for leaving"},{"time":54.27,"text":"请原谅我的离去"},{"time":59.75,"text":"To the hall I could meet my true self"},{"time":59.75,"text":"前往能与真我相遇的礼堂"},{"time":66.16,"text":"Forgive me for dreaming"},{"time":66.16,"text":"请原谅我的梦想"},{"time":71.91,"text":"Of the lines I sing can be what I believe"},{"time":71.91,"text":"我所颂之词正如我的信仰"},{"time":108.15,"text":"Look it up, stars of oath"},{"time":108.15,"text":"抬头看，誓言的星群"},{"time":112.59,"text":"Then grow up"},{"time":112.59,"text":"然后成长"},{"time":117.1,"text":"From a doll to the one standing alone"},{"time":117.1,"text":"从玩偶到独自站立之人"},{"time":124.95,"text":"To my beloved sisters"},{"time":124.95,"text":"致我心爱的姐妹"},{"time":130.46,"text":"I’m going to write new stories"},{"time":130.46,"text":"我将要书写新的故事"},{"time":135.33,"text":"You may not like it"},{"time":135.33,"text":"你们或许不会喜欢"},{"time":139.2,"text":"But my word is here"},{"time":139.2,"text":"但我的誓言在此"},{"time":141.96,"text":"Solid as a stone"},{"time":141.96,"text":"坚如磐石"},{"time":166.7,"text":"Forgive me for leaving"},{"time":166.7,"text":"请原谅我的离去"},{"time":172.28,"text":"To the hall I could meet my true self"},{"time":172.28,"text":"前往能与真我相遇的礼堂"},{"time":178.7,"text":"Forgive me for dreaming"},{"time":178.7,"text":"请原谅我的梦想"},{"time":184.32,"text":"Of the lines I sing can be what I believe"},{"time":184.32,"text":"我所颂之词正如我的信仰"},{"time":200.0,"text":"曲：雪人Snowman"},{"time":201.0,"text":"词：大九_LN"},{"time":202.0,"text":"调：陌生来访"},{"time":203.0,"text":"绘：多尔及利亚"}]},{"title":"04 Holophrasis","lyrics":[{"time":0.0,"text":"Holophrasis"},{"time":4.0,"text":"曲：星辉p"},{"time":5.0,"text":"词：大九_LN"},{"time":6.0,"text":"调：瑞安Ryan不跑调"},{"time":7.0,"text":"绘：多尔及利亚"},{"time":21.1,"text":"Where else can I go?"},{"time":21.1,"text":"我还能去何处"},{"time":24.43,"text":"Elusive, like a ghost of thought"},{"time":24.43,"text":"如幻如魅，思绪的幽灵"},{"time":29.5,"text":"Sorry to be a stain"},{"time":29.5,"text":"抱歉在这未受损的世界中"},{"time":30.99,"text":"Of the unscathed world"},{"time":30.99,"text":"成为一团污点"},{"time":33.57,"text":"My last word for you isn’t here"},{"time":33.57,"text":"留给你的遗言不在此处"},{"time":39.3,"text":"The moon pulls gleaming waves"},{"time":39.3,"text":"月亮牵引粼粼波光"},{"time":42.8,"text":"Erasing ways I can escape"},{"time":42.8,"text":"抹除我逃生的路"},{"time":47.23,"text":"What should I write for epitaph"},{"time":47.23,"text":"我应写下什么作墓志铭"},{"time":52.46,"text":"You can’t say no again"},{"time":52.46,"text":"让你无法再次拒绝"},{"time":55.86,"text":"Puns in lines"},{"time":55.86,"text":"句行中的双关"},{"time":57.6,"text":"Stories you once hate"},{"time":57.6,"text":"你曾厌恶的故事"},{"time":61.33,"text":"I’ll remember them"},{"time":61.33,"text":"我都会记得它们"},{"time":64.46,"text":"Everyone shall stand on their feet"},{"time":64.46,"text":"每个人应以自己的双足而立"},{"time":73.03,"text":"Even the death will take their breath away"},{"time":73.03,"text":"即使死亡会夺走他们的气息"},{"time":105.5,"text":"Orbs of will rolling towards the edge of my tombstone"},{"time":105.5,"text":"自我意志凝结成光球滚向墓碑边缘"},{"time":123.7,"text":"Which of rules can I break"},{"time":123.7,"text":"我能打破哪条规则"},{"time":127.14,"text":"Shrilling noise across the night of symphony"},{"time":127.14,"text":"伴以尖啸声穿越交响之夜"},{"time":131.9,"text":"Life only finds its worth with the end"},{"time":131.9,"text":"生命在终结时才得知它的价值"},{"time":136.8,"text":"Crowned by honour’s wreath"},{"time":136.8,"text":"加冕荣誉的花环"},{"time":140.27,"text":"The sun descends, then rises higher than"},{"time":140.27,"text":"太阳降落，然后升得更高"},{"time":145.8,"text":"As it can"},{"time":145.8,"text":"尽其可能"},{"time":148.98,"text":"Everyone shall find their bouquet"},{"time":148.98,"text":"每个人都会找到属于自己的花束"},{"time":157.6,"text":"Even the death will take their breath"},{"time":157.6,"text":"即使死亡也会夺走他们的气息"},{"time":170.2,"text":"Their stories remain here, alive"},{"time":170.2,"text":"故事在此鲜活地延续"}]},{"title":"05 I'm","lyrics":[{"time":0.0,"text":"I’m"},{"time":4.0,"text":"曲：litterzy"},{"time":5.0,"text":"词：大九_LN"},{"time":6.0,"text":"调：litterzy"},{"time":7.0,"text":"绘：多尔及利亚"},{"time":23.0,"text":"Conditional love on me"},{"time":23.0,"text":"所获之爱附有条件"},{"time":26.2,"text":"Anachronistic ruling"},{"time":26.2,"text":"不合时宜的统治"},{"time":29.13,"text":"When shadows creep on the moon"},{"time":29.13,"text":"当阴影爬上月亮"},{"time":32.34,"text":"The true light can be seen"},{"time":32.34,"text":"真正的光芒才显现"},{"time":35.0,"text":"A silhouette of belief"},{"time":35.0,"text":"信仰的轮廓"},{"time":37.86,"text":"I purl it on my skins"},{"time":37.86,"text":"将它以反针织于皮肤"},{"time":41.01,"text":"Challenging what I can’t flee"},{"time":41.01,"text":"挑战无法逃避之物"},{"time":44.3,"text":"As a drop of sea"},{"time":44.3,"text":"如海中的一滴水"},{"time":47.22,"text":"Rebirth from the blind as I dreamed"},{"time":47.22,"text":"从盲目中复生，如我曾梦见"},{"time":51.62,"text":"Thousands of years passed then"},{"time":51.62,"text":"千年过去"},{"time":54.96,"text":"Time to give a chance to your kid"},{"time":54.96,"text":"是时候给你的孩子机会"},{"time":60.77,"text":"See with my eyes"},{"time":60.77,"text":"用自己的眼睛看"},{"time":63.99,"text":"Instead of kneeling by your seat"},{"time":63.99,"text":"而非跪在你的座位旁"},{"time":70.67,"text":"Sins grow upon the stalk"},{"time":70.67,"text":"罪孽攀缠于百合的茎"},{"time":73.6,"text":"Of lily as scars in black"},{"time":73.6,"text":"如黑色瘢痕"},{"time":76.62,"text":"How can purity go back"},{"time":76.62,"text":"纯洁何以通过"},{"time":79.83,"text":"Via rusting tracks"},{"time":79.83,"text":"生锈的轨迹回归"},{"time":82.4,"text":"I’ve noticed all lies you made"},{"time":82.4,"text":"已注意到你的一切谎言"},{"time":85.36,"text":"Illusional tricks you played"},{"time":85.36,"text":"你所玩的幻觉把戏"},{"time":88.63,"text":"So how can I just wait for one more day"},{"time":88.63,"text":"那么我如何能多待一天"},{"time":94.77,"text":"Rebirth from the deaf as I dreamed"},{"time":94.77,"text":"从耳聋中复生，如我曾梦见"},{"time":99.12,"text":"Thousands of years passed then"},{"time":99.12,"text":"千年过去"},{"time":102.26,"text":"Time to give a chance to your kid"},{"time":102.26,"text":"是时候给你的孩子机会"},{"time":108.22,"text":"Hear with my ears"},{"time":108.22,"text":"用自己的耳朵听"},{"time":111.78,"text":"Instead of losing in blank hymn"},{"time":111.78,"text":"而非迷失在空白的赞歌中"},{"time":141.8,"text":"Retrieve my glory in grace"},{"time":141.8,"text":"在恩典中找回我的荣耀"},{"time":146.53,"text":"Betrayal’s a few names"},{"time":146.53,"text":"背叛有多种名字"},{"time":149.69,"text":"One’s called being free from the past"},{"time":149.69,"text":"其一叫作摆脱过去的自由"},{"time":155.78,"text":"When I can’t say words entwined in my mind"},{"time":155.78,"text":"在难言心中交织话语之时"},{"time":165.83,"text":"Rebirth from the death like you did"},{"time":165.83,"text":"如你一般从死亡中复生"},{"time":170.14,"text":"Thousands of years waited then"},{"time":170.14,"text":"已等待千年"},{"time":173.42,"text":"Time to give a chance to my soul"},{"time":173.42,"text":"是时候给灵魂机会"},{"time":179.38,"text":"Sing in my tone"},{"time":179.38,"text":"用我的曲调高唱"},{"time":182.71,"text":"Instead of hiding my feelings"},{"time":182.71,"text":"而非一味隐藏感受"}]}]}